<job>
  <name>mi_driver</name>
  <description>Lab 5 solution: run the injection once per control row</description>
  <extended_description>Reads control.csv, then executes mi_inject.ktr once for every row, mapping the row's filename and separator onto the FEED_FILE / FEED_SEP parameters. Add a feed by adding a line to control.csv - no pipeline changes.</extended_description>
