  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>In the driver job, the entry that runs this transformation is followed by the entry that runs mi_inject.ktr with Execute for every input row ticked. 
Because the rows were copied to the result, the job runs the injector three times, once per row, and each row lands in the injector's Get rows 
from result step as the filename and separator to inject into the template. Adding a fourth feed is one more line in control.csv; this 
transformation never changes.

Two details worth knowing: the path is hard-coded to the workshop folder, so if you save the files elsewhere must repoint the File tab; and 
the transformation declares no parameters.</note>
